{"name": "Distant Shore: BRETAGNE", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Distant Shore: BRETAGNE is an atmospheric physics sandbox where <strong>Portal</strong> meets <strong>Mirror\u2019s Edge</strong>. Follow the intended parkour trail or use magnetic forces to build your own way forward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/cdaac0e8565eaab211161e8eeaf55d45.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/19b35d2ae346c2e48022dd6c4b6f377d.poster.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/19b35d2ae346c2e48022dd6c4b6f377d.webm?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/19b35d2ae346c2e48022dd6c4b6f377d.mp4?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend and break metal obstacles to your will. Use your magnetic gauntlets to turn physics into your ultimate creative tool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/34fe6172305df12db76d261ff9243d71.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/649d32a4d488c1e3f761b3fbba17775a.poster.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/649d32a4d488c1e3f761b3fbba17775a.webm?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/649d32a4d488c1e3f761b3fbba17775a.mp4?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap across dizzying heights using fluid, momentum-based movement. Combine magnetic powers with parkour to reach impossible speeds and discover hidden routes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/43672a17a13c4d81dab321d4de106d81.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/995002456c3cb73a8f7e2088803ae3bc.poster.avif?t=1772014699\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/995002456c3cb73a8f7e2088803ae3bc.webm?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/extras/995002456c3cb73a8f7e2088803ae3bc.mp4?t=1772014699\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of the West Zone while searching for your missing brother. Beware the strange cloud in the sky that watches your every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist Now and play the Demo on February 23, 2026</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Distant Shore: BRETAGNE is a first-person parkour physics based game, where you wield your magnetic gauntlets to move, bend and break metal obstacles. Navigate through a ravaged world to complete the mission given by your employer.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892370/fb907918ab33051ec70676007842d2e8eb50802f/header.jpg?t=1772014699", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Parkour", "3D Platformer", "Physics", "Exploration", "Post-apocalyptic", "Action-Adventure"], "developers": "DISTANT SHORE", "publishers": "DISTANT SHORE", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3892370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Z1YzwPR0aEA", "first_seen": 1771801200.0, "review_rank": 1121}